Package: dimControl
Title: Tools for 3D Geometric Processing and Dimensional Analysis
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
      person("Nataly", "Romaris", , "nataly.romaris@udc.es", role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Olamar", "Benavente", role = "aut"),
      person("Ruben", "Fernandez-Casal", role = "aut"),
      person("Salvador", "Naya", role = "aut"),
      person("Javier", "Tarrio-Saavedra", role = "aut")
      )
Maintainer: Nataly Romaris <nataly.romaris@udc.es>
Description: A collection of tools for geometric processing, reconstruction, and
    dimensional analysis of three-dimensional data. It includes functionality for 
    point cloud and mesh processing, boundary extraction, angle estimation, component 
    detection, and surface analysis.
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5),
    graphics
